{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>But to Cain and to his offering He did not regard.</b> He did not regard Cain the offerer, who was unacceptable, and likewise his offering, which was unfit for acceptance." "<b>And it burned.</b> In his jealousy toward his brother, who had been accepted." "<b>And his face fell.</b> In shame, for the El had put him to shame in his own reasoning and did not accept him."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:29:00.610608772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}